    "轻点切换当前使用的 Provider，左滑编辑或删除。兼容所有 OpenAI 格式服务，API Key 仅保存在设备 Keychain 中。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap to switch providers; swipe left to edit or delete. Works with any OpenAI-compatible service. API keys are stored only in the device Keychain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "语音识别": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speech Recognition"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "识别方式": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Engine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本地识别（离线）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On-device (offline)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fish Audio 云端": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fish Audio (cloud)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "识别语言": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Language"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "云端识别按停顿分段上传（约 3~8 秒一段），自动判别语言，术语与标点准确率更高；需要网络，音频将发送至 Fish Audio。Key 仅保存在 Keychain。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cloud recognition uploads in pause-aligned chunks (about 3–8 s each) and detects the language automatically, with better accuracy on terminology and punctuation. Requires a network connection; audio is sent to Fish Audio. The key is stored only in the Keychain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本地识别完全离线、零延迟，音频不出设备。本地模型分语种，语言选错会严重影响准确率（如用中文模型识别英文会议）；纯英文会议请选 English。首次使用某语言需下载模型。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On-device recognition is fully offline with no latency, and audio never leaves the device. Models are per-language — picking the wrong one badly hurts accuracy (e.g. a Chinese model on an English meeting), so choose English for English meetings. The first use of a language downloads its model."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "问题检测": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Question Detection"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LLM 漏检兜底扫描": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LLM sweep for missed questions"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "提前检测（不等定稿）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Early detection (before finalize)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "兜底扫描：每累计约 100 字或 20 秒，用一次小额 LLM 调用扫描规则漏掉的问题，结束会议前做收尾扫描（会议中可快速开关）。提前检测：连续说话时语音识别可能几十秒不定稿，开启后在灰色未定稿文本上即时检测问题，命中并确认说完后立刻出卡。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sweep: every ~100 characters or 20 seconds, one small LLM call catches questions the rules missed, plus a final sweep when the meeting ends (toggleable mid-meeting). Early detection: during continuous speech, recognition may not finalize for tens of seconds — this spots questions in the grey draft text and creates the card as soon as the question is complete."
          }
        }
      }
    },
