    "我们开始今天的项目 Alpha 评审会，先同步一下进度": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Let's start today's Project Alpha review, first a quick status update"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上周的迭代已经全部上线了，数据看起来不错": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last week's iteration is fully shipped and the numbers look good"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "什么是向量数据库？它和普通数据库有什么区别": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What is a vector database? How is it different from a regular database"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "嗯那个，我们这个项目 Q3 的内部预算大概是多少来着": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um so, what was our internal Q3 budget for this project again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTP 和 WebSocket 的区别是什么": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What's the difference between HTTP and WebSocket"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "对了，这个方案的压测数据你那边测过的没": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "By the way, did you ever run load tests on this design"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我先问一下我们 API 网关的限流阈值是多少然后我继续同步后端进展用户服务重构完成了百分之八十剩下的订单接口这周五之前迁移完数据库上周治理了慢查询响应时间下降了三成": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "First let me ask what our API gateway rate limit is then I'll continue with backend progress the user service refactor is eighty percent done the remaining order endpoints migrate before Friday and last week we tuned slow queries so response time dropped thirty percent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "好，那今天就先到这里": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alright, let's wrap up here for today"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "示例-项目资料.md": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sample-Project-Notes.md"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "示例-评审会发言稿": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sample-Review-Script"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "# 项目 Alpha Q3 预算\n项目 Alpha 的 Q3 内部预算总额为 120 万元：研发 80 万、市场 25 万、运维 15 万。预算审批人为财务部王总，超支需提前两周申请。\n\n# 项目 Beta Q3 预算\n项目 Beta 的 Q3 内部预算总额为 200 万元：研发 120 万、市场 50 万、运维 30 万。预算审批人为财务部李总。\n\n# API 网关配置\n生产环境 API 网关的限流阈值为每秒 5000 次请求（5000 QPS），突发流量上限 8000 QPS，超出后返回 429。灰度环境限流为 1000 QPS。\n\n# 压测数据（2026 年 6 月）\n核心下单接口压测结果：P99 延迟 180ms，平均延迟 45ms；单集群最大吞吐 3200 QPS；瓶颈在订单库写入，计划 Q3 分库分表解决。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "# Project Alpha Q3 Budget\nProject Alpha's internal Q3 budget totals 1.2M CNY: 800k engineering, 250k marketing, 150k operations. Approver is Wang from Finance; overruns need two weeks' notice.\n\n# Project Beta Q3 Budget\nProject Beta's internal Q3 budget totals 2.0M CNY: 1.2M engineering, 500k marketing, 300k operations. Approver is Li from Finance.\n\n# API Gateway Configuration\nThe production API gateway rate limit is 5000 requests per second (5000 QPS), with a burst ceiling of 8000 QPS; excess traffic gets a 429. The staging limit is 1000 QPS.\n\n# Load Test Results (June 2026)\nCore checkout endpoint: P99 latency 180ms, average 45ms; peak single-cluster throughput 3200 QPS. The bottleneck is order-table writes, to be addressed by sharding in Q3."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我们开始今天的项目 Alpha 评审会，先同步一下进度。\n上周的迭代已经全部上线了，数据看起来不错。\n接下来说一下大家关心的几个技术问题。\n我先问一下我们 API 网关的限流阈值是多少。\n然后我继续同步后端进展，用户服务重构完成了百分之八十。\n剩下的订单接口这周五之前迁移完。\n数据库上周治理了慢查询，响应时间下降了三成。\n好，那今天就先到这里。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Let's start today's Project Alpha review, first a quick status update.\nLast week's iteration is fully shipped and the numbers look good.\nNext, a few technical questions everyone has been asking about.\nFirst let me ask what our API gateway rate limit is.\nThen I'll continue with backend progress: the user service refactor is eighty percent done.\nThe remaining order endpoints migrate before Friday.\nWe tuned slow queries last week and response time dropped thirty percent.\nAlright, let's wrap up here for today."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**问：%@**（%@）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Q: %@** (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    }
